load @term/seed/code/manifold/riemannian
  find riemannian-manifold

# The Levi-Civita connection: on a Riemannian manifold, the unique way to differentiate vector fields that is
# compatible with the metric and has no torsion, the canonical notion of parallel transport. It is what defines
# straightness (geodesics) and curvature on a curved space, the mathematical object general relativity is built from.
# The form carries the Riemannian manifold the connection lives on.
form levi-civita-connection
  link manifold, like riemannian-manifold
